      {
        "y_pos": 185,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 14,
        "widget": {
          "text": {
            "content": "### SnapMirror Relationship Status\n- **Metric**: `snapmirror_relationship_status`\n- **Description**: This table panel displays the average status of SnapMirror relationships for each project over the past 5 minutes. The status values are:\n  - `0`: Idle\n  - `1`: Transferring\n  - `2`: Quiescing\n  - `3`: Paused\n  - `4`: Failed\n- **How to Read**: The table lists each project along with the average status of its SnapMirror relationships. The average status is calculated over the past 5 minutes, providing a snapshot of the replication activity. For example, a value of `1.5` suggests that relationships are mostly in the `Transferring` state, with some fluctuations.",
            "format_": 1,
            "style": {
              "background_color": "#FFFFFF",
              "text_color": "#212121",
              "horizontal_alignment": 1,
              "vertical_alignment": 1,
              "padding": 1,
              "font_size": 4,
              "pointer_location": 0
            }
          },
          "title": "",
          "id": ""
        },
        "x_pos": 0
